      de: ["Höhe von ca. 452 Metern.", "Gehört zum Las Terrazas Komplex.", "Name bedeutet 'Schemel' aufgrund der Form.", "Trainingslager von Che Guevara (1960er).", "Denkmal erinnert an Revolutionskämpfer.", "Bietet Ausblick auf die Südküste Kubas."],
      hu: ["Kb. 452 méteres magasság.", "A Las Terrazas ökológiai körzet része.", "Neve alakja miatt 'zsámolyt' jelent.", "Che Guevara itt képezte ki a milíciát.", "A csúcson forradalmi emlékmű található.", "Kilátás nyílik a déli tengerpartra."],
      ro: ["Altitudine de aproximativ 452 metri.", "Parte a complexului ecologic Las Terrazas.", "Numele înseamnă „taburet” datorită formei.", "Sit de antrenament pentru Che Guevara în anii '60.", "Monument dedicat revoluționarilor pe vârf.", "Oferă panoramă spre coasta sudică a Cubei."],
      en: ["Elevation of about 452 meters.", "Located within the Las Terrazas complex.", "Name means 'stool' due to its summit shape.", "Training site for Che Guevara in the 1960s.", "Features a monument to revolutionary fighters.", "Offers views extending to Cuba's southern coast."],
